    "title": "Immediate Requirement Production Engineer at NTPC",
    "description": "We at NTPC are looking for an experienced Production Engineer based out of Visakhapatnam. If you are a result-oriented professional with a passion for excellence, we want to hear from you.\n\nAbout NTPC:\nNTPC is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Coordinate with logistics for dispatching finished goods\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Conduct root cause analysis for quality rejections and defects\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Chartered Accountant (ICAI)\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in 5S\n• Proficiency in ISO 9001\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in APQP\n• Proficiency in Project Management\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with NTPC!",
